'''Flash in the Pan''' (露出狂, ''Roshutsukyō'', '''Flasher''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

